{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"392b6dd1578cd257","type":"text","text":"# 0. Thrust-time curve","x":-1537,"y":-450,"width":301,"height":50},
		{"id":"81a4c672b8cba5a9","type":"text","text":"## Nomenclatures\n\n| Param    | Description      |\n| -------- | ---------------- |\n| $t$      | Time             |\n| $s$      | simulation step  |\n| $P$      | pressure         |\n| $F$      | thrust           |\n| $I_{sp}$ | specific impulse |\n\n| Subscripts | Description           |\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\n| $c$        | combustion chamber    |\n| $t$        | throat                |\n| $e$        | exit                  |\n| $a$        | ambient (surrounding) |\n","x":-1134,"y":-593,"width":268,"height":500},
		{"id":"8be8e70d5c2a6d9c","type":"text","text":"| Param     | Description        | Formula                                                                          |\n| --------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| $$C_{F}$$ | Thrust coefficient | $$C_{F} = C_{F0} + \\frac{A_{e}}{A_{t}}\\left( R_P - \\frac{P_{a}}{P_{c}} \\right)$$ |\n","x":-1171,"y":20,"width":460,"height":140},
		{"id":"61a80b5c6f0715e3","type":"text","text":"| Param | Description | Formula                 |\n| ----- | ----------- | ----------------------- |\n| $$F$$ | Thrust      | $$F = P_{c}A_{t}C_{F}$$ |\n","x":-1511,"y":-198,"width":340,"height":123},
		{"id":"c6fb543ef81cfe57","type":"text","text":"\n| Param   | Description          | Formula               |\n| ------- | -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| $A_{b}$ | Burning surface area | $A_{b} = J_s \\cdot L$ |\n","x":-1960,"y":550,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"3e0e113d5156918d","type":"text","text":"| Param     | Description      | Formula                                                                                           |\n| --------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| $$P_{c}$$ | Chamber pressure | $$P_{c} = \\left( \\frac{a \\cdot \\rho_{p} \\cdot C^* \\cdot A_{b}}{A_{t}} \\right)^{\\frac{1}{1 - n}}$$ |\n","x":-1970,"y":200,"width":570,"height":158},
		{"id":"e8eb06502b741476","type":"text","text":"| Param        | Description | Formula                                           |\n| ------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| $$\\Delta_t$$ | Time step   | $$\\Delta_t = \\frac{\\Delta_r}{a \\cdot P_{c}^{n}}$$ |\n","x":-1930,"y":-198,"width":330,"height":144},
		{"id":"8489553433f186b1","type":"text","text":"# Simulation\n\n| Param        | Description                                        | Formula                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| $$\\Delta_r$$ | Burned web thickness. depends on simulation params | $$\\Delta_r = \\mathrm{const}$$ |\n| $$J_s$$      | perimeter of propellant cross-section at step $s$  | (function of step)            |\n","x":-1990,"y":800,"width":460,"height":270},
		{"id":"3a4c846a7826d518","type":"text","text":"## Unused - subject to rearrangement\n\n| Param       | Description | Formula                                                                     |\n| ----------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| $$\\dot{r}$$ | Burn rate   | $$\\dot{r} = \\frac{\\mathrm{\\Delta}r}{\\mathrm{\\Delta}t} = a \\cdot P_{c}^{n}$$ |\n","x":-2020,"y":-593,"width":430,"height":213},
		{"id":"ee9567681a3d112c","type":"text","text":"\n| Param    | Description                      | Formula                               |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| $A_{t}$  | Nozzle throat cross-section area | $A_{t} = \\frac{\\pi d_{t}^{2}}{4}$     |\n| $A_{e}$  | Nozzle exit cross-section area   | $A_{e} = \\frac{\\pi d_{e}^{2}}{4}$<br> |\n","x":-1380,"y":428,"width":443,"height":136},
		{"id":"c5113edb1758fef8","type":"text","text":"###  ||\n### \\\\/","x":-845,"y":496,"width":65,"height":104},
		{"id":"d7c54f5e82508f0b","type":"text","text":"\n| Param      | Description                              | value                    | units                      |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| $L$        | propellant length                        | $1$<br>                  | $m$                        |\n| $R$        | Final radius                             | $0.2$                    | $m$                        |\n| $d_{t}$    | throat diameter                          | $0.05$                   | $m$                        |\n| $d_{e}$    | nozzle exit diameter                     | $0.1505$                 | $m$                        |\n| $a$        | burn rate coefficient                    | $1.24 \\cdot 10^{-5}$<br> | $\\frac{m}{s \\cdot Pa^{n}}$ |\n| $n$        | pressure exponent                        | $0.4$<br>                |                            |\n| $\\rho_{p}$ | propellant density                       | $1600$<br>               | $\\frac{kg}{m^{3}}$         |\n| $C^*$      | characteristic velocity                  | $1500$<br>               | $\\frac{m}{s}$              |\n| $C_{F0}$   | matched thrust coefficient               | $1.6$                    |                            |\n| $\\gamma$   | Heat capacity ratio                      | $1.2$                    |                            |\n| $P_{a}$    | Ambient pressure                         | $101325$                 | $Pa=1atm.$                 |\n| $R_P$      | Pressure ratio (Environment vs. chamber) | $1/70$                   |                            |\n\n\n","x":-1360,"y":720,"width":620,"height":440},
		{"id":"79c0265a3e1e2db8","type":"text","text":"## Unused - constant value\n\n| Param      | Description                            | Formula                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| $$C_{F0}$$ | Matched thrust coefficient             | $$C_{F0} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2\\gamma^{2}}{\\gamma - 1} \\cdot \\left( \\frac{2}{\\gamma + 1} \\right)^{\\frac{\\gamma + 1}{\\gamma - 1}} \\cdot \\left( 1 - \\left( \\frac{P_{e}}{P_{c}} \\right)^{\\frac{\\gamma - 1}{\\gamma}} \\right)}$$ |\n| $$\\gamma$$ | heat capacity ratio                    | $$\\gamma=c_p/c_v$$<br>                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| $$R_P$$    | Pressure ratio Environment vs. chamber | $$P_{e}/P_{c}$$                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n","x":-640,"y":860,"width":609,"height":420}
	],
